.TH "__hhs_venv" "1" "2025-11-20" "HomeSetup" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
__hhs_venv - Activate/Deactivate the HomeSetup python venv.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
usage: __hhs_venv [-a|-d|-t]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Activate/Deactivate the HomeSetup python venv.
.SH ARGUMENTS
None.
.SH DETAILS
.nf

    Options:
      -a | --activate     : Makes the venv active.
      -d | --deactivate   : Makes the venv inactive.
      -t | --toggle       : Toggles the venv between active/inactive.

  Notes:
    - if no option is specified, it will check whether it is active/inactive.
.fi
